1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,140
Aap notice karte honge ki bahut sare log bahut under confident hote hain

2
00:00:04,140 --> 00:00:06,360
unko confidence nahi hota hai apne andar

3
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:10,370
lekin aap pattern notice karoge un logo ka jo bahut jyada confidence hota hai jinke andar

4
00:00:10,370 --> 00:00:11,530
to dekho basically

5
00:00:12,220 --> 00:00:14,150
jinke andar bhi confidence hota hai na

6
