wo apne vision ko lekar ke unko thoughts jo hoti hain bahut clarity hota hai unke mind me apne thoughts ko lekar ke

7
00:00:20,890 --> 00:00:22,840
koi if but nahi hota hai

8
00:00:22,840 --> 00:00:27,650
to jitni jyada clarity apne aap ko apne vision ko lekar ke hoga jitne jyada aapke thoughts clear honge

9
00:00:27,870 --> 00:00:32,530
utni hi jyada siddhat se aap apni chijo ko execute karoge aur aap jab chijo ko execute karne lag jate ho

10
00:00:32,530 --> 00:00:35,880
